     "id": "adf939a4-ab14-4f48-bb9b-1e989239c711"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.6 Derive weightPower",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Derive weightPower from the power-law fit in [fMinHz, fMaxHz] *)\nModule[{s = DCTAdmittanceStats`FilterAdmittanceStats[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]},\n  weightPower = s[\"WeightPowerDerived\"];\n  Print[\"weightPower \\[LeftArrow] \", NumberForm[weightPower, {4, 2}],\n    \"   (\\[Alpha] = \", NumberForm[s[\"PowerLawAlpha\"], {4, 2}], \")\"]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">weightPower ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aehoz-93z96et\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7LTAuODd9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-0.87</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   (α = </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aehp0-56s2rar\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC44N30=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.87</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: weightPower ←[formula]   (α =[formula])",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a5ad773e-dfba-47f2-bc46-57f96ee0eb89"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Parameter Tuning\nEach sweep fits the representative file over a range of one parameter (others locked from the params cell). Adjust ranges as needed, then update params cell.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3.1 Tau grid",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Tau grid padding: the grid extends tauMinFactor/tauMaxFactor beyond the direct\n   1/(2pi*fMax) and 1/(2pi*fMin) limits. Extra range prevents Tikhonov edge artifacts\n   — peaks near the boundaries of the plot are outside the data window and suspect. *)\ntauMinFactor = 0.1;   (* decade below fMax: tau_min = tauMinFactor/(2pi*fMax) *)\ntauMaxFactor = 10.;   (* decade above fMin: tau_max = tauMaxFactor/(2pi*fMin) *)\n\nPrint[\"Tau grid: \",\n  NumberForm[tauMinFactor/(2 Pi fMaxHz), {3,2}], \" \\[LongDash] \",\n  NumberForm[tauMaxFactor/(2 Pi fMinHz), {3,2}], \" s  (data window: \",\n  NumberForm[1./(2 Pi fMaxHz), {3,4}], \" — \",\n  NumberForm[1./(2 Pi fMinHz), {3,2}], \" s)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Tau grid: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aei36-8io5c7q\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wMH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.00</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> — </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aei36-xliqbnu\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC42M30=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.63</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> s  (data window: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aei37-nis063k\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wMDAzfQ==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0003</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> — </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aei38-0td98mm\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wNn0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> s)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Tau grid:[formula] —[formula] s  (data window:[formula] —[formula] s)",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f7d1b521-bbe6-4845-bd35-057420ad8d1a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3.2 Lambda sweep",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Compute g(k) spectrum for each λ — used by the L-curve and verification plot below *)\nlambdas = {0, 1*^-5, 1*^-4, 3*^-4, 0.001, 0.003, 0.01, 0.03, 0.1, 0.3};\nlSweep  = DCTSensitivity`LambdaSweep[repFile, lambdas,\n  \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n  \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n  \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n  \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n  \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n  \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n];\nlSweepSpecs = Map[\n  <|\"File\" -> \"\\[Lambda]=\" <> ToString[N[#[\"Lambda\"]]], \"Spec\" -> #[\"Spec\"]|> &,\n  Select[lSweep, AssociationQ[#[\"Spec\"]] &]\n];\nPrint[Length[lSweepSpecs], \" \\[Lambda] values computed.\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aeivt-swn00lg\" data-page-width-em=\"52\" data-latex-b64=\"MTA=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> λ values computed.</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula] λ values computed.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "502540b2-2765-4dfc-9486-7e1f9c41b53f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a. L-curve: choosing λ\nPlot of roughness ∥D²g∥ (x-axis) vs data misfit ∥Y – Ŷ∥ (y-axis) for each λ tested above. λ increases from bottom-right (spiky spectrum, low misfit) toward top-left (smooth spectrum, high misfit). The **corner** — maximum curvature — is the optimal balance point.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.1 Plot L-curve",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* L-curve: roughness ||D²g|| vs weighted admittance misfit sqrt(sum w_i |DeltaY_i|^2)\n   The weighted misfit is what NNLS actually minimises — has more dynamic range than ObjY. *)\nlCurveData = Table[\n  Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]], yD, yF, w},\n    yD = sp[\"YIntData\"];\n    yF = sp[\"YIntFit\"];\n    w  = Abs[yD]^weightPower;  (* same weighting as inner NNLS solve *)\n    { Norm[Differences[Differences[sp[\"g\"]]]],           (* roughness: ||D²g||      *)\n      Sqrt[Total[w * (Re[yF-yD]^2 + Im[yF-yD]^2)]] }    (* weighted misfit: ||WDY|| *)\n  ], {i, Length[lSweepSpecs]}];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotLCurve[lCurveData, lSweepSpecs[[All, \"File\"]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"106\" data-out-n=\"647\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"35\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[647]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_ntxmoq9fuexg.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_ntxmoq9fuexg.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* L-curve: roughness ||D²g|| vs weighted admittance misfit sqrt(sum w_i |DeltaY_i|^2)\n   The weighted misfit is what NNLS actually minimises — has more dynamic range than ObjY. *)\nlCurveData = Table[\n  Module[{sp = lSweepSpecs[[i, \"Spec\"]], yD, yF, w},\n    yD = sp[\"YIntData\"];\n    yF = sp[\"YIntFit\"];\n    w  = Abs[yD]^weightPower;  (* same weighting as inner NNLS solve *)\n    { Norm[Differences[Differences[sp[\"g\"]]]],           (* roughness: ||D²g||      *)\n      Sqrt[Total[w * (Re[yF-yD]^2 + Im[yF-yD]^2)]] }    (* weighted misfit: ||WDY|| *)\n  ], {i, Length[lSweepSpecs]}];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotLCurve[lCurveData, lSweepSpecs[[All, \"File\"]]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "cb030fe6-6e96-490f-bb7e-ab2d2740dde3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.2 Set λ",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* From the L-curve above: corner is around λ ≈ 10⁻³ — roughness drops steeply below,\n   misfit is flat above. Lock it in for the drift fit. *)\nlambdaND = 1*^-3;\nPrint[Style[\"lambdaND ← \", Bold, White], Style[lambdaND, Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aejrb-88kg0an\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyNmZmZmZmZ9e1x0ZXh0e2xhbWJkYU5EICRcZ2V0cyQgfX19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">lambdaND </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\"> </span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9aejrd-k4p5e0d\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyMwMGZmMDB9e1xmcmFjezF9ezEwMDB9fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">1000</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"color:#00ff00;border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula][formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "498b67f0-512c-4706-a83a-1d6a4765b681"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 3a.3 Verify λ",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right).\n   All plotting via DCTPlots subroutines (PlotGK, PlotLambdaResiduals). *)\nRow[{\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, ImageSize -> 460],\n  Spacer[12],\n  DCTPlots`PlotLambdaResiduals[lSweepSpecs]\n}, Alignment -> Center]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"107\" data-out-n=\"650\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"39\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[650]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1sdkr8xzn6d00.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1sdkr8xzn6d00.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Verify chosen λ: g(k) overlay (left) and Bode residuals (right).\n   All plotting via DCTPlots subroutines (PlotGK, PlotLambdaResiduals). *)\nRow[{\n  DCTPlots`PlotGK[lSweepSpecs, ImageSize -> 460],\n  Spacer[12],\n  DCTPlots`PlotLambdaResiduals[lSweepSpecs]\n}, Alignment -> Center]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "fe7474e3-ac7d-472a-9530-066dae169292"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Drift Fit\nRun once (or after changing parameters). `driftFiles` and `goodSpecs` are used by the plot cells below.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4.1 Batch drift fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fileDecimation = 1;  (* 1 = all files, N = every Nth — reduce for faster tuning *)\n\ndriftFiles = sortFiles[\n  Take[\n    sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]],\n    ;; ;; fileDecimation\n  ]\n];\nPrint[\"Found \", Length[driftFiles], \" files (decimated) from \", FileNameTake[dataDir]];\n\nresults = Table[\n  Module[{spec},\n    If[Mod[i, Max[1, Round[Length[driftFiles]/10]]] == 1,\n      Print[i, \" / \", Length[driftFiles], \"  \", FileNameTake[driftFiles[[i]]]]\n    ];\n    spec = Quiet @ Check[\n      DCT`DCTSpectrum[driftFiles[[i]],\n        \"LambdaND\"      -> lambdaND,\n        \"FMinUse\"       -> fMinHz,\n        \"FMaxUse\"       -> fMaxHz,\n        \"WeightPower\"   -> weightPower,\n        \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n        \"TauMinFactor\"  -> tauMinFactor,\n        \"TauMaxFactor\"  -> tauMaxFactor\n      ], $Failed\n    ];\n    <|\"File\" -> driftFiles[[i]], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n  ],\n  {i, Length[driftFiles]}\n];\n\ngoodSpecs = Select[results, #OK === True &];\nPrint[Style[ToString[Length[goodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[driftFiles]] <> \" fits succeeded.\", Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Found </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq9ael2r-s0qrzrb\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files (decimated) from </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">drift_03252026</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Found[formula] files (decimated) fromdrift_03252026",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0287f37e-7255-4d2e-b534-71f714c23ce6"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
