  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a. Drift Plots\nRun each cell independently. `goodSpecs` must exist (run the fit cell above first).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.1 g(k) by electrode",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Legend = elapsed time at 6 h marks; y-axis in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, DCTPlots`HourMarkLabels[e1Specs], \"GScale\" -> 1*^9]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"821465\" data-output-id=\"108\" data-out-n=\"658\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"45\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[658]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_uhu6j08slwvj.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_uhu6j08slwvj.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Legend = elapsed time at 6 h marks; y-axis in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, DCTPlots`HourMarkLabels[e1Specs], \"GScale\" -> 1*^9]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "05b68e28-b614-4c50-9836-d4c4d7565a0c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.2 Cumulative capacitance",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
