       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Rs and C0 vs time — one trace per electrode *)\nRow[{DCTPlots`PlotRsVsTime[goodSpecs], DCTPlots`PlotC0VsTime[goodSpecs]}, Spacer[20]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "fa013f89-ff99-435f-ad93-6d8be90b40e1"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.6 k-range definitions",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* k ranges for peak tracking — each window captures a distinct electron-transfer population *)\nkPeakRanges = {{10., 100.}, {100., 500.}};",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
