  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 6.1 Export figures",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "exportFigure = True; (* set to True to export all figures as PDF + PNG *)\n\nIf[exportFigure,\n  figDir = FileNameJoin[{DirectoryName[dataDir], \"figures\"}];\n  If[!DirectoryQ[figDir], CreateDirectory[figDir]];\n  Print[\"Saving to: \", figDir];\n\n  (* PDF = vector (for LaTeX / print); PNG = 300 dpi raster (paste into Google\n     Docs / Slides \\[Dash] those don't accept PDF or SVG natively). *)\n  exportFig[fig_, name_] := (\n    Export[FileNameJoin[{figDir, name <> \".pdf\"}], fig];\n    Export[FileNameJoin[{figDir, name <> \".png\"}], fig, ImageResolution -> 300];\n    Print[\"\\[Checkmark] \", name]\n  );\n\n  (* Figures in notebook order, Publication theme (white). *)\n  Block[{DCTPlots`$DCTTheme = \"Publication\"},\n\n    (* Method validation \\[Dash] synthetic recovery: figure + parameter table *)\n    If[ValueQ[simRec],\n      exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotCombValidation[simK, gSim, simRec], \"validation_comb\"]];\n    If[ValueQ[validationTable],\n      exportFig[validationTable, \"validation_table\"]];\n\n    (* Section 1 \\[Dash] Lin-KK residuals *)\n    exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotKKResiduals[kkRep], \"drift_kkResiduals\"];\n\n    (* 4a.1 \\[Dash] drift g(k): E1, hour-mark legend, nF/decade *)\n    exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, DCTPlots`HourMarkLabels[e1Specs], \"GScale\" -> 1*^9],\n      \"drift_gK\"];\n\n    (* 4a.5 \\[Dash] Rs and C0 vs time, aligned time axes *)\n    exportFig[\n      Column[{\n        DCTPlots`PlotRsVsTime[goodSpecs, ImagePadding -> {{85, 20}, {38, 8}}],\n        DCTPlots`PlotC0VsTime[goodSpecs, ImagePadding -> {{85, 20}, {38, 8}}]\n      }, Alignment -> Left, Spacings -> 1],\n      \"drift_RsC0\"];\n\n    (* 4a.7 \\[Dash] k_peak vs time, per k-range *)\n    exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotKPeakVsTime[goodSpecs, kPeakRanges], \"drift_kPeak\"];\n\n    (* One g(k) heatmap per electrode, titled (rasterised \\[Dash] 100s of columns) *)\n    KeyValueMap[\n      (exportFig[\n         Rasterize[DCTPlots`PlotDCTHeatmap[#2, PlotLabel -> Style[#1, 18]],\n           ImageResolution -> 300],\n         \"drift_heatmap_\" <> #1] &),\n      GroupBy[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] &]\n    ];\n\n    (* Section 5 \\[Dash] concentration g(k): E1, area-normalised *)\n    If[ValueQ[concE1] && Length[concE1] > 0,\n      exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1, Automatic, \"AreaNorm\" -> True], \"conc_gK\"]];\n\n    (* 5a.2 \\[Dash] fraction folded vs [ligand], linear, with 3/4-state model fits *)\n    If[ValueQ[fitResult] && ValueQ[ffPerElectrode],\n      exportFig[biophysLinearPlot[], \"biophys_linear\"]];\n  ];\n\n  Print[Style[\"Export done.\", Bold, Darker[Green]]],\n\n  Print[Style[\"exportFigure = False \\[Dash] set to True to export.\", Italic, GrayLevel[0.6]]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
